      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think a compromise can be made.\n\nAvatar performance stats can show the stats of an avatar at run time, and the stats it would have with everything active. Users can then choose to have their performance settings use either runtime or all active as the filter, or to use the worst of the 2, or the best of the 2 as the filter.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5d08725651f9e20de7ffa242",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68",
        "alias": "Evolutionary Vicuna",
        "aliasID": "65ba088fed6eefce4ca8dc62",
