      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: I prefer that as it would cost less or add an option to enable/disable checking for disabled objects where it's disabled by default leaving a note that it may not be accurate for every avatar when enabled. This way it won't confuse new people or people who trust that it's 100% accurate.",
